SUMMARY:Third Friday art walk · Downtown Durham
LOCATION:~20 downtown galleries and studios (Durham Arts Council\, 21c\, Go
 lden Belt studios\, etc.)\, Downtown Durham (e.g.\, Durham Arts Council\, 
 120 Morris St\, Durham\, NC 27701)
DESCRIPTION:Monthly gallery crawl with openings\, receptions and open studi
 os\; the same art crowd turns up each month and receptions are easy places
  to chat.\n\nNov 20 includes the Weird Windows holiday event\; DAC gallery
  openings Dec 18\, Jan 15 & Feb 19 (6-8pm)\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; 
 venue map at downtowndurham.com/thirdfriday\n\nBefore you go: Individual v
 enue hours vary.\n\nhttps://downtowndurham.com/thirdfriday/\n\nListed on S
 ame Time Next Week.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/thirdfriday/
END:VEVENT
