SUMMARY:Free improv jam · Mettlesome
LOCATION:Mettlesome (Golden Belt)\, 800 Taylor St\, Suite 9-156\, Durham\, 
 NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:Free weekly improv jam: names go in a bucket and everyone gets 
 on stage\; beginner-friendly on-ramp to Mettlesome's community.\n\nHarold 
 Night show ($8) at 7:30 just before\n\nHow to join: Just show up. Improv 1
 01 classes start early Jan 2027 (registration ~early Dec)\n\nBefore you go
 : Only Nov 19 is posted right now. Later dates show up on Mettlesome's cal
 endar as they're announced.\n\nhttps://thisismettlesome.com\n\nListed on S
 ame Time Next Week.
URL:https://thisismettlesome.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d-improv-games-20261114@same-time-next-week
