DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T150000
SUMMARY:Improv jam · Moon Dog Meadery
LOCATION:Moon Dog Meadery & Bottle Shop\, 1104 Broad St\, Suite C\, Durham\
 , NC 27705
DESCRIPTION:Casual improv-games meetup twice a month\; all welcome to play 
